//! The `position-visibility` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! enables conditionally hiding an anchor-positioned element depending on, for example, whether it
//! is overflowing its containing element or the viewport.
//!
//! Initial: anchors-visible. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: always | [ anchor-valid || anchor-visible || no-overflow ]
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-anchor-position-1/#propdef-position-visibility
//!
//! Author guide:
